---
// Status chip — same family as the `LIVE` badge on the eduardferre.dev hub.
---

<span
  class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/[0.08] px-3 py-1
         font-mono text-[10px] md:text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-emerald-700
         dark:border-emerald-400/25 dark:bg-emerald-400/[0.07] dark:text-emerald-300"
>
  <span class="live-dot text-[8px] leading-none" aria-hidden="true">●</span>
  <slot />
</span>
